1
00:00:00,359 --> 00:00:02,489
(Raj:)And we made it in only three hours.

2
00:00:04,663 --> 00:00:06,993
(Raj:)- Sounds just like store-bought.
- Heh, heh.

3
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:11,470
(Howard:)Okay, give me a superhero pose...

4
00:00:11,637 --> 00:00:15,037
(Howard:)...and I will scan you into the computer
for your action figure.

5
00:00:15,974 --> 00:00:17,844
(Raj:)Oh, I wish I was in better shape.

6
00:00:20,512 --> 00:00:24,542
(Howard:)Stop holding your stomach in,
I'll give you a six-pack with the computer.

7
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:25,980
(Raj:)Oh, okay, great.

8
00:00:26,151 --> 00:00:28,211
(Raj:)Now, I can look like Val Kilmer
as Batman...

9
00:00:28,387 --> 00:00:31,047
(Raj:)...instead of Val Kilmer
as he looks today.

10
00:00:34,393 --> 00:00:36,953
(Howard:)All right. You can suck it in a little bit.

11
00:00:39,965 --> 00:00:41,195
Cooper, we have a problem.

12
00:00:41,366 --> 00:00:45,326
Your work is really not
at the level I expected it to be.

13
00:00:45,637 --> 00:00:48,697
I know. Go ahead and mock me.

14
00:00:48,874 --> 00:00:51,534
But use small words so I understand.

15
00:00:52,711 --> 00:00:55,871
Don't play dumb with me.
We both know what your problem is.

16
00:00:56,648 --> 00:00:59,178
- We do?
- You have a girlfriend.

